      "id": "1e399c83-b03c-4b7f-8be9-7cb292964b81",
      "name": "Acknowledgement",
      "description": {
        "content": "An acknowledgement is a means of indicating that the member who made a transaction has been formally thanked. Every acknowledgement is made by the associated member, optionally on behalf of another fundraising entity.\nAcknowledgements should be created after a donator has been contacted via email, comment, etc.",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
